<title>USA: Micron Electronics, 3Com in pact.</title>
<headline>Micron Electronics, 3Com in pact.</headline>
<dateline>NAMPA, Idaho 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micron Electronics Inc and 3Com Corp said Wednesday they had formed a strategic alliance to integrate 3Com networking technologies into Micron product and service offerings.</p>
<p>The relationship will allow Micron to deliver complete solutions to customers by pre-configuring their systems with 3Com networking technologies, the companies said.  </p>
<p>Micron and 3Com said they would work closely to develop network-ready product offerings and technologies.</p>
<p>Micron will also participate in 3Com's branding and compliance campaign.</p>
<p>Micron will ship its ClientPro product line and selected Millennia products certified as 3Com network-ready systems at no additional charge, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
